<div id="A7.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">unit_text</span> again starts with the definition from Section <a href="#A7.SS1" title="G.1 Tree search ‣ Appendix G System and agent prompts ‣ Code World Models for GeneralGame Playing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.1</span></a> then adds the following test for added inference function:</p>
</div>
