<div id="lstnumberx148" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx148.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">except</span><span id="lstnumberx148.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx148.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">StopIteration</span><span id="lstnumberx148.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">:</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx149" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx149.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">  </span><span id="lstnumberx149.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">pass</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx150" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx150.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">self</span><span id="lstnumberx150.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx150.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">assertEqual</span><span id="lstnumberx150.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx150.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player_id</span><span id="lstnumberx150.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx150.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx150.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">get_current_player</span><span id="lstnumberx150.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx150.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">state</span><span id="lstnumberx150.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">))</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">where <span id="A7.SS3.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">INITIAL_STATE</span> is provided at the beginning of the unit tests and is the static first state of the game. <span id="A7.SS3.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">obs_action_history</span> is the history of observations and actions for player <span id="A7.SS3.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">player_id</span> for which we want to resample the history of actions that lead to the
current observations.</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Note the presence of print statements inside the unit test. The last ten lines of standard output are provided to the LLM in addition to the error message.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.4 </span>Hidden state inference function synthesis</h3>

<div id="A7.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">function_signature</span> again starts with the version from Section <a href="#A7.SS1" title="G.1 Tree search ‣ Appendix G System and agent prompts ‣ Code World Models for GeneralGame Playing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.1</span></a>, then adds the inference function definition:</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A7.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx151" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx151.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">def</span><span id="lstnumberx151.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">resample_state</span><span id="lstnumberx151.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx151.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">obs_action_history</span><span id="lstnumberx151.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">:</span><span id="lstnumberx151.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">list</span><span id="lstnumberx151.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">[</span><span id="lstnumberx151.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">tuple</span><span id="lstnumberx151.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">[</span><span id="lstnumberx151.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">PlayerObservation</span><span id="lstnumberx151.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx151.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">Action</span><span id="lstnumberx151.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">|</span><span id="lstnumberx151.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">None</span><span id="lstnumberx151.20" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">]],</span><span id="lstnumberx151.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player_id</span><span id="lstnumberx151.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">:</span><span id="lstnumberx151.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">int</span><span id="lstnumberx151.26" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">)</span><span id="lstnumberx151.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.28" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">-&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx151.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx151.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">list</span><span id="lstnumberx151.31" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">[</span><span id="lstnumberx151.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">int</span><span id="lstnumberx151.33" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">]:</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx152" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx152.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">  </span><span id="lstnumberx152.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">"""</span><span id="lstnumberx152.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">Stochastically</span><span id="lstnumberx152.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">sample</span><span id="lstnumberx152.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">one</span><span id="lstnumberx152.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">of</span><span id="lstnumberx152.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx152.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">reachable</span><span id="lstnumberx152.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">statess</span><span id="lstnumberx152.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">for</span><span id="lstnumberx152.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player</span><span id="lstnumberx152.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">given</span><span id="lstnumberx152.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx152.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">observation</span><span id="lstnumberx152.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">and</span><span id="lstnumberx152.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">action</span><span id="lstnumberx152.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">history</span><span id="lstnumberx152.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx152.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">recreates</span><span id="lstnumberx152.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx152.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player</span><span id="lstnumberx152.40" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">’</span><span id="lstnumberx152.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">s</span><span id="lstnumberx152.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx152.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">observation</span><span id="lstnumberx152.44" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">."""</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.SS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">unit_test</span> again starts with the definition from Section <a href="#A7.SS1" title="G.1 Tree search ‣ Appendix G System and agent prompts ‣ Code World Models for GeneralGame Playing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.1</span></a> then adds the following test for added inference function above:</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A7.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,b2JzX2FjdGlvbl9oaXN0b3J5ID0ge29ic19hY3Rpb25faGlzdG9yeX0KcGxheWVyX2lkID0ge3BsYXllcl9pZH0KcmVzYW1wbGVkX3N0YXRlID0gcmVzYW1wbGVfc3RhdGUob2JzX2FjdGlvbl9oaXN0b3J5LCBwbGF5ZXJfaWQpCgpzZWxmLmFzc2VydEVxdWFsKG9ic19hY3Rpb25faGlzdG9yeVstMV1bMF0sIGdldF9vYnNlcnZhdGlvbnMocmVzYW1wbGVkX3N0YXRlKVtwbGF5ZXJfaWRdKQ==" download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx153" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx153.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">obs_action_history</span><span id="lstnumberx153.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx153.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx153.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx153.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">{</span><span id="lstnumberx153.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">obs_action_history</span><span id="lstnumberx153.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx154" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx154.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player_id</span><span id="lstnumberx154.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx154.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx154.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx154.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">{</span><span id="lstnumberx154.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player_id</span><span id="lstnumberx154.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx155" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx155.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">resampled_state</span><span id="lstnumberx155.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx155.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx155.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx155.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">resample_state</span><span id="lstnumberx155.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx155.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">obs_action_history</span><span id="lstnumberx155.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx155.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx155.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player_id</span><span id="lstnumberx155.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">)</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx156" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx157" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx157.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">self</span><span id="lstnumberx157.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx157.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">assertEqual</span><span id="lstnumberx157.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx157.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">obs_action_history</span><span id="lstnumberx157.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">[-1][0],</span><span id="lstnumberx157.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx157.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">get_observations</span><span id="lstnumberx157.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx157.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">resampled_state</span><span id="lstnumberx157.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">)[</span><span id="lstnumberx157.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">player_id</span><span id="lstnumberx157.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">])</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.5 </span>Hidden history inference function synthesis, closed deck</h3>

<div id="A7.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">function_signature</span> is similar to that in Section <a href="#A7.SS2" title="G.2 Perfect information games ‣ Appendix G System and agent prompts ‣ Code World Models for GeneralGame Playing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.2</span></a>:</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A7.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
