<div id="lstnumberx182" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx182.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">  </span><span id="lstnumberx182.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">raise</span><span id="lstnumberx182.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx182.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">ValueError</span><span id="lstnumberx182.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">(’</span><span id="lstnumberx182.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">Failed</span><span id="lstnumberx182.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx182.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx182.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx182.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">iterate</span><span id="lstnumberx182.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx182.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">through</span><span id="lstnumberx182.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx182.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">all</span><span id="lstnumberx182.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx182.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">observations</span><span id="lstnumberx182.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">.’)</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx183" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx183.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">except</span><span id="lstnumberx183.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx183.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">StopIteration</span><span id="lstnumberx183.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">:</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx184" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx184.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">  </span><span id="lstnumberx184.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">pass</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS5.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS5.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Again, this is very similar to <span id="A7.SS5.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">unit_test</span> in Section <a href="#A7.SS2" title="G.2 Perfect information games ‣ Appendix G System and agent prompts ‣ Code World Models for GeneralGame Playing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.2</span></a>, but also covers the terminal state of the game and it’s associated reward.</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS5.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS5.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Note that no transition unit tests are added as we do not have access to the state. However, just testing the inference function is not enough to ensure that the resulting closed deck game is playable. Instead, a random play test is added to <span id="A7.SS5.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">unit_test</span>:</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS5.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A7.SS5.p8.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx185" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx185.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">state</span><span id="lstnumberx185.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx185.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx185.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx185.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">{</span><span id="lstnumberx185.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">initial_state</span><span id="lstnumberx185.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx186" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx186.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">rg</span><span id="lstnumberx186.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx186.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx186.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx186.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">np</span><span id="lstnumberx186.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx186.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">random</span><span id="lstnumberx186.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx186.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">RandomState</span><span id="lstnumberx186.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">({</span><span id="lstnumberx186.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">seed</span><span id="lstnumberx186.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#007D00;">})</span>
</div>
