<div id="A7.SS6.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS6.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Additionally, if the ISMCTS process fails due to, e.g., poor understanding of the game termination criteria in the CWM, we fall back to resampling the state and then return a uniformly sampled legal action from that state.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.7 </span>Value function synthesis</h3>

<div id="A7.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
