<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>Sample synthesized CWMs and inference functions</h2>

<div id="A9.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show the resulting CWM after tree search refinement on perfect and imperfect information games, and for the latter we include both open and closed deck inference. This includes inference and value functions when they exist.</p>
</div>
<section id="A9.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.1 </span>Tic-tac-toe (perfect information)</h3>

<div id="A9.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A9.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
